SF0065 Data privacy-government entities.
Sponsored By: Select Committee on Blockchain, Financial Technology
and Digital Innovation Technology
AN ACT relating to the administration of the government; requiring government
entities to adopt policies for the collection, access, security and use of
personal data as specified; requiring specific personal data policies; providing
definitions; specifying applicability; and providing for effective dates.
12/28/2024 Bill Number Assigned
1/2/2025 S Received for Introduction
1/14/2025 S Introduced and Referred to S09 - Minerals
1/24/2025 S09 - Minerals:Recommend Amend and Do Pass 5-0-0-0-0
