1/24/2025 S Placed on General File
SF0065SS001/ADOPTED
Page 4-after line 12 Insert and renumber as necessary:
"(ii) A government entity may transfer personal data to
nongovernment entity contracted by the government entity to provide or assist
with government services provided by the government entity. Any contract for
services with a nongovernment entity shall include requirements for the
protection of personal data consistent with this article. Any personal data
transferred pursuant to this paragraph shall be returned or destroyed by the
nongovernment entity once the personal data is no longer necessary for the
provision of the government service. No nongovernment entity shall maintain,
sell, transfer, process or otherwise use the personal data in any manner except
as necessary to provide the contracted service;".
Page 4-line 14 Delete "(ii)" and insert "(iii)".
Page 5-line 1 Delete "(iii)" and insert "(iv)". ANDERSON, CHAIRMAN
SF0065SW001/ADOPTED
Page 5-line 2 After "data" insert "in a manner".
Page 8-after line 2 Insert:
"(d) A government entity to which the Health Insurance Portability and
Accountability Act or the Family Education Rights and Privacy Act applies that
is compliant with a written data collection and retention policy that meets the
requirements of the Health Insurance Portability and Accountability Act or the
Family Education Rights and Privacy Act shall be deemed compliant with this
section.". ROTHFUSS
